<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2039118938"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1680653017"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="スロウリー"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="明透"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ASU"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:13.247"><div begin="00:01.871" end="03:02.197"><p begin="00:01.871" end="00:04.847" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">焦がれてる合間に溜め込む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">问题在心神不宁的间隙积累</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ga re te ru a i ma ni ta me ko mu</span></p><p begin="00:04.948" end="00:07.352" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">尤もらしいアレンジメント<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这发展或许早已注定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo 't to mo ra shi i a re n ji me n to</span></p><p begin="00:08.075" end="00:10.944" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">余計なことは口にしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不必再多费口舌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ke i na ko to ha ku chi ni shi na i</span></p><p begin="00:11.445" end="00:13.727" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">あのシーンが伝えてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一幕本身便已说明一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no shi i n ga tsu ta e te ru</span></p><p begin="00:13.727" end="00:15.076" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">尖がりはこれ位<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愤怒争执差不多到此为止</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ga ri ha ko re ku ra i</span></p><p begin="00:15.217" end="00:16.612" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">答え今も出ない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管至今也得不出答案</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ta e ha i ma mo de na i</span></p><p begin="00:16.652" end="00:18.418" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">絶賛悪足掻き中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眼下 却还在拼死挣扎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze 's sa n wa ru a ga ki chu u</span></p><p begin="00:18.418" end="00:20.047" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">クリーンにしたい脳内<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要索性清空的大脑里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ri i n ni shi ta i no u na i</span></p><p begin="00:20.367" end="00:21.967" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">タラレバ重ねだす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依旧满怀幻想死不悔改</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ra re ba ka sa ne da su</span></p><p begin="00:21.967" end="00:23.507" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">天照らす王道ベイべ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天光照亮了捷径 Baby</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ma te ra su o u do u be i be</span></p><p begin="00:23.698" end="00:26.031" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">大渋滞よメーデー御目見得<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我却止步不前 Mayday 那便敬请观看我拙劣的初演吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i ju u ta i yo me e de e o me mi e</span></p><p begin="00:26.973" end="00:29.963" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">くだらないと端に寄せる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说很无聊 于是渐行渐远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku da ra na i to ha shi ni yo se ru</span></p><p begin="00:30.097" end="00:32.431" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">嵌まった分忘れたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经的沉迷 如今全都想忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ma 't ta bu n wa su re ta i</span></p><p begin="00:33.231" end="00:37.529" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">行き急ぐ性分だから気付けないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是因为我生性急躁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki i so gu sho u bu n da ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:37.724" end="00:39.454" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">浮かべてスロウリー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">整个人好似缓缓漂浮半空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ka be te su ro u ri i</span></p><p begin="00:39.454" end="00:43.778" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">廻りだした猛るのやりこなす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始旋转 你的处理粗暴却合理</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma wa ri da shi ta ta ke ru no ya ri ko na su</span></p><p begin="00:43.968" end="00:48.072" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">ありふれているフィーリング模した反応だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只好想象寻常人该有的感受</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ri fu re te i ru fi i ri n gu</span></p><p begin="00:48.448" end="00:50.168" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">足りないとこ埋めよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">掩藏起自己的空虚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ri na i to ko u me yo u</span></p><p begin="00:50.168" end="00:51.895" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">深まってスロウリー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">窒息感缓缓加深</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ka ma 't te su ro u ri i</span></p><p begin="00:51.927" end="00:56.335" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">仰ぐデイライト嘘みたいに優しい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仰头望见日光洒落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a o gu de i ra i to</span></p><p begin="00:56.382" end="01:00.751" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">決まってんだ知り過ぎてるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没什么好意外的 毕竟我实在太了解你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ma 't te n da shi ri su gi te ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:00.868" end="01:03.709" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">柔らかい光に混ぜてゆけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就任你溶入柔和的光线中去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya wa ra ka i hi ka ri ni ma ze te yu ke</span></p><p begin="01:10.055" end="01:12.925" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">割と真面目に捉えてんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实我很认真地在领会</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ri to ma ji me ni to ra e te n da</span></p><p begin="01:13.109" end="01:16.147" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">煙に巻いたら常に有耶無耶<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是烟幕卷起 常常看不清晰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke mu ni ma i ta ra tsu ne ni u ya mu ya</span></p><p begin="01:16.483" end="01:19.648" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">心地良いマンネリの吹き溜まり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是安心待在各个舒适圈里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko chi yo i ma n ne ri no fu ki da ma ri</span></p><p begin="01:19.821" end="01:22.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">いかにも抜けられないようだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">完全不愿脱离</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ka ni mo nu ke ra re na i yo u da</span></p><p begin="01:22.480" end="01:24.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">無いもの強請ってるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">提出强人所难的要求</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na i mo no ne da 't te ru no</span></p><p begin="01:24.029" end="01:25.533" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">間延びしたエコー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望迟缓的回声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma no bi shi ta e ko o</span></p><p begin="01:25.638" end="01:28.559" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">思い知るまでは途切れさせないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我所有领会之前不要中断</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i shi ru ma de ha to gi re sa se na i de</span></p><p begin="01:28.721" end="01:32.058" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">期待通りなかなかの分からず屋なの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正如你所预料的那样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ta i do o ri na ka na ka no</span></p><p begin="01:32.058" end="01:33.833" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">束の間のイレイテッド<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快乐也转瞬即逝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ka no ma no i re i te 'd do</span></p><p begin="01:33.833" end="01:35.505" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">浮かべてスロウリー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">整个人好似缓缓漂浮半空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ka be te su ro u ri i</span></p><p begin="01:35.505" end="01:39.863" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">騒ぎだした予感も連鎖して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">躁动的预感也开始发生连锁反应</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa wa gi da shi ta yo ka n mo re n sa shi te</span></p><p begin="01:39.993" end="01:44.225" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">認めたくない思い模した反応だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中生出不愿承认的忧虑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi to me ta ku na i o mo i</span></p><p begin="01:44.525" end="01:46.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">消えるまで待っていよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">干脆等到这怪异感消失吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki e ru ma de ma 't te i yo u</span></p><p begin="01:46.299" end="01:48.051" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">深まってスロウリー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而思念缓缓加深</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ka ma 't te su ro u ri i</span></p><p begin="01:48.051" end="01:52.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">何処へでも転がって行ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论哪里 跌跌撞撞我也能前去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko he de mo ko ro ga 't te i ke ru</span></p><p begin="01:52.439" end="01:56.711" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">決まってんだ知り過ぎてるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没什么好意外的 毕竟我实在太了解你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ma 't te n da shi ri su gi te ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:57.013" end="01:59.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">柔らかい光に混ぜてゆけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就溶入柔和的光线中去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya wa ra ka i hi ka ri ni ma ze te yu ke</span></p><p begin="02:00.910" end="02:03.151" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">向こう側覗いたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">偷偷看向你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ko u ga wa no zo i ta ra</span></p><p begin="02:03.991" end="02:06.611" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">ただ寂しく思えたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只会让我感到寂寞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da sa bi shi ku o mo e ta n da</span></p><p begin="02:07.102" end="02:09.412" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">変わる必要もない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但不必有所改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ru hi tsu yo u mo na i</span></p><p begin="02:10.031" end="02:12.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">やがて交わるんだから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们终会有交集</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ga te ma ji wa ru n da ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:12.932" end="02:15.929" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">くだらないと端に寄せる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说着很无聊 于是渐行渐远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku da ra na i to ha shi ni yo se ru</span></p><p begin="02:16.080" end="02:18.613" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">残った分で愉しめる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情享受剩余的时间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">no ko 't ta bu n de ta no shi me ru</span></p><p begin="02:19.151" end="02:23.528" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">塗り急がないで夜を越え踊るのさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别急着抹掉过去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">nu ri i so ga na i de</span></p><p begin="02:23.680" end="02:25.412" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">浮かべてスロウリー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">整个人好似缓缓漂浮半空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ka be te su ro u ri i</span></p><p begin="02:25.412" end="02:29.762" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">廻りだした猛るのやりこなす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始旋转 你的处理粗暴却合理</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma wa ri da shi ta ta ke ru no ya ri ko na su</span></p><p begin="02:29.911" end="02:34.043" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">ありふれているフィーリング模した反応だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只好想象寻常人该有的感受</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ri fu re te i ru fi i ri n gu</span></p><p begin="02:34.399" end="02:36.031" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">足りないとこ埋めよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">掩藏起自己的空虚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ri na i to ko u me yo u</span></p><p begin="02:36.122" end="02:37.951" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">深まってスロウリー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">窒息感缓缓加深</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ka ma 't te su ro u ri i</span></p><p begin="02:37.951" end="02:42.244" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">仰ぐデイライト嘘みたいに優しい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仰头望见日光洒落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a o gu de i ra i to</span></p><p begin="02:42.355" end="02:46.622" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">決まってんだ知り過ぎてるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没什么好意外的 毕竟我实在太了解你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ma 't te n da shi ri su gi te ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:46.843" end="02:49.661" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">柔らかい光に混ぜてゆけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就任你溶入柔和的光线中去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya wa ra ka i hi ka ri ni ma ze te yu ke</span></p><p begin="02:53.048" end="02:55.933" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">柔らかい光に混ぜてゆけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就任你溶入柔和的光线中去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya wa ra ka i hi ka ri ni ma ze te yu ke</span></p><p begin="02:59.292" end="03:02.197" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">気のまま開放捨て置くだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听从心声 放开自己 放下过去 如此便好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki no ma ma ka i ho u su te o ku da ke</span></p></div></body></tt>